{
  "id": "2TI.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "2TI",
  "reference": "2 Timothy 4",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2TI 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I charge ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in the sight of God, and of Christ Jesus, who shall judge the living and the dead, and by his appearing and his kingdom: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "preach the word; be urgent in season, out of season; reprove, rebuke, exhort, with all longsuffering and teaching. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the time will come when they will not endure the sound doctrine; but, having itching ears, will heap to themselves teachers after their own lusts; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and will turn away their ears from the truth, and turn aside unto fables. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But be thou sober in all things, suffer hardship, do the work of an evangelist, fulfil thy ministry. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I am already being offered, and the time of my departure is come. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have fought the good fight, I have finished the course, I have kept the faith: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "henceforth there is laid up for me the crown of righteousness, which the Lord, the righteous judge, shall give to me at that day; and not to me only, but also to all them that have loved his appearing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Give diligence to come shortly unto me: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for Demas forsook me, having loved this present world, and went to Thessalonica; Crescens to Galatia, Titus to Dalmatia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Only Luke is with me. Take Mark, and bring him with thee; for he is useful to me for ministering. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Tychicus I sent to Ephesus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The cloak that I left at Troas with Carpus, bring when thou comest, and the books, especially the parchments. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alexander the coppersmith did me much evil: the Lord will render to him according to his works: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of whom do thou also beware; for he greatly withstood our words. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At my first defence no one took my part, but all forsook me: may it not be laid to their account. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the Lord stood by me, and strengthened me; that through me the message might be fully proclaimed, and that all the Gentiles might hear: and I was delivered out of the mouth of the lion. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Lord will deliver me from every evil work, and will save me unto his heavenly kingdom: to whom ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the glory for ever and ever. Amen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Salute Prisca and Aquila, and the house of Onesiphorus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erastus remained at Corinth: but Trophimus I left at Miletus sick. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Give diligence to come before winter. Eubulus saluteth thee, and Pudens, and Linus, and Claudia, and all the brethren.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Lord be with thy spirit. Grace be with you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
